data: {"id": "dbab163f85bb4ffa-thinking-parallel_evidence-1182", "run_id": "dbab163f85bb4ffa", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Pod 当前状态（kubectl_describe + kubectl_get_yaml）\n- **Phase**: Pending\n- **Container `app`**: Reason=`CreateContainerConfigError`, message=`couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input`\n- **Restart Count**: 0\n- **Owner**: ReplicaSet `workload-6584f97c76` → Deployment `workload`\n- **Container 配置**: image=`xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`, command=`python3 -c \"import time; time.sleep(3600)\"`\n- **环境变量**: 从 describe 输出看 Environment 区块为空，但错", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788776079336, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "dbab163f85bb4ffa-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "dbab163f85bb4ffa", "seq": 1183, "ts_ms": 1788776087007, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 42.791, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-04", "name": "workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/dbab163f85bb4ffa-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "3be91850c961804b98aeab77eceec707be4c63f410b62af732e4e8a4572b7c26", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "93d585e14136fd14fe211ae7281b95830d7ac46dec92a37ecbe263dec2228359"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "dbab163f85bb4ffa-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "dbab163f85bb4ffa", "seq": 1184, "ts_ms": 1788776087008, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "dbab163f85bb4ffa-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "dbab163f85bb4ffa", "seq": 1185, "ts_ms": 1788776096939, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 9.932, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1816, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p` | CreateContainerConfigError | Pod workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p 处于 CreateContainerConfigError 状态，容器无法启动。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input` (Fact ID: `fact-23eccf9c0669`) | 直接证实挂载失败的物理原因，定位到具体的缺失键值 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | Container `app` 处于 `CreateContainerConfigError`，原因是 \"couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input\" (Fact IDs: `fact-9d9e451a9250`, `fact-e8ad6c7589b9`) | 确认容器因配置读取失败而处于等待状态，无法进入运行态 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod 处于 `Pending`，`Ready` 和 `ContainersReady` 均为 `False`，原因 `ContainersNotReady` (Fact IDs: `fact-3b169b5e63cc` 至 `fact-d12e61cf398c`) | 描述 Pod 最终表现状态，证实容器组未就绪 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"CreateContainerConfigError\"}` = `1` (Fact ID: `fact-7db868cd26da`) | 独立证实容器处于配置错误导致的等待状态 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = `0` (Fact ID: `fact-f9007a0fe9d9`) | 证实故障发生在启动前，无重启发生，排除了运行期崩溃的可能性 |\n\n**证据分析：**\nKubernetes 事件与容器状态一致指向 Secret Key 缺失问题，且 Metrics 独立印证了该状态。由于容器从未成功启动，Logging 与 Tracing 维度未产生应用数据，这与预期物理行为完全一致。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置引用 Secret key 'unavailable-key' (事实) → Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input 中不存在该 key → kubelet 无法挂载配置 → Pod 处于 CreateContainerConfigError 状态，容器无法启动\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：** Pod `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p` 的容器配置中引用了 Secret `aiops-case-04/workload-input` 中不存在的 Key `unavailable-key`。\n\n这一配置错误导致 `kubelet` 在初始化容器时无法挂载相应的配置卷，进而触发 `CreateContainerConfigError` 状态并阻止容器启动（引用证据 `fact-23eccf9c0669`, `fact-9d9e451a9250`）。现有证据充分，无需补充其他决定性事实。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p` | CreateContainerConfigError | Pod workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p 处于 CreateContainerConfigError 状态，容器无法启动。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input` (Fact ID: `fact-23eccf9c0669`) | 直接证实挂载失败的物理原因，定位到具体的缺失键值 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | Container `app` 处于 `CreateContainerConfigError`，原因是 \"couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input\" (Fact IDs: `fact-9d9e451a9250`, `fact-e8ad6c7589b9`) | 确认容器因配置读取失败而处于等待状态，无法进入运行态 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod 处于 `Pending`，`Ready` 和 `ContainersReady` 均为 `False`，原因 `ContainersNotReady` (Fact IDs: `fact-3b169b5e63cc` 至 `fact-d12e61cf398c`) | 描述 Pod 最终表现状态，证实容器组未就绪 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"CreateContainerConfigError\"}` = `1` (Fact ID: `fact-7db868cd26da`) | 独立证实容器处于配置错误导致的等待状态 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = `0` (Fact ID: `fact-f9007a0fe9d9`) | 证实故障发生在启动前，无重启发生，排除了运行期崩溃的可能性 |\n\n**证据分析：**\nKubernetes 事件与容器状态一致指向 Secret Key 缺失问题，且 Metrics 独立印证了该状态。由于容器从未成功启动，Logging 与 Tracing 维度未产生应用数据，这与预期物理行为完全一致。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置引用 Secret key 'unavailable-key' (事实) → Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input 中不存在该 key → kubelet 无法挂载配置 → Pod 处于 CreateContainerConfigError 状态，容器无法启动\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：** Pod `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p` 的容器配置中引用了 Secret `aiops-case-04/workload-input` 中不存在的 Key `unavailable-key`。\n\n这一配置错误导致 `kubelet` 在初始化容器时无法挂载相应的配置卷，进而触发 `CreateContainerConfigError` 状态并阻止容器启动（引用证据 `fact-23eccf9c0669`, `fact-9d9e451a9250`）。现有证据充分，无需补充其他决定性事实。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

